{"assets":["/statement-assets/04b010df1ffdef86f156e62bdf2d8ab03407f3d4a7d120a44b45d0dc6e809653.png","/statement-assets/098b02bf5602e2c04c4fd546d44392725b3e94e9f9fc929db4d1f319af9c888c.png","/statement-assets/edfadc20d5b5eb994a4a1b9f7250f67b6e1842f327280bc0969191a022de3362.png","/statement-assets/f6f1f412072fe7f2949dc2a86c445df47fec825b746af4f3436c1bb5c3c06b67.png","/statement-assets/71a74f63922b53e802f8f18fba93c891bec752685a7553e3c1e94f849dd4d0c2.png","/statement-assets/c9bbbff833f285db40b698f2f29b172903e82879b4689faedc29b9b49fb660fa.png","/statement-assets/222f92bd73d8a032070ed9e544cea32c337c99aefad7a0499040752879b5a4e7.png","/statement-assets/9b7705829b5f740e1d6dcd36808aa8167a8581c563f9ce072958d760b4df34bc.png","/statement-assets/5c927a937603c18245504a27dbedf7e4d107eaa687693201e17d906b56b3803f.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"226","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Flying Saucer Segments"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"An expedition group flew from planet ACM-1 to Earth in order to study the bipedal species (its representatives don't even have antennas on their heads!)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The flying saucer, on which the brave pioneers set off, consists of three sections. These sections are connected by a chain: the 1-st section is adjacent only to the 2-nd one, the 2-nd one — to the 1-st and the 3-rd ones, the 3-rd one — only to the 2-nd one. The transitions are possible only between the adjacent sections."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The spacecraft team consists of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" aliens. Each of them is given a rank — an integer from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":". The ranks of all astronauts are distinct. The rules established on the Saucer, state that an alien may move from section "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" to section "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" only if it is senior in rank to all aliens who are in the segments "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" (besides, the segments "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b"},{"kind":"text","text":" are of course required to be adjacent). Any alien requires exactly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" minute to make a move. Besides, safety regulations require that no more than one alien moved at the same minute along the ship."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Alien "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"A"},{"kind":"text","text":" is senior in rank to alien "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"B"},{"kind":"text","text":", if the number indicating rank "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"A"},{"kind":"text","text":", is more than the corresponding number for "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"B"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"At the moment the whole saucer team is in the 3-rd segment. They all need to move to the 1-st segment. One member of the crew, the alien with the identification number CFR-140, decided to calculate the minimum time (in minutes) they will need to perform this task."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Help CFR-140, figure out the minimum time (in minutes) that all the astronauts will need to move from the 3-rd segment to the 1-st one. Since this number can be rather large, count it modulo "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two space-separated integers: "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ n, m ≤ 109)"},{"kind":"text","text":" — the number of aliens on the saucer and the number, modulo which you should print the answer, correspondingly."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single number — the answer to the problem modulo "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1 10\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 8\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample the only crew member moves from segment 3 to segment 2, and then from segment 2 to segment 1 without any problems. Thus, the whole moving will take two minutes."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"To briefly describe the movements in the second sample we will use value "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/04b010df1ffdef86f156e62bdf2d8ab03407f3d4a7d120a44b45d0dc6e809653.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", which would correspond to an alien with rank "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":" moving from the segment in which it is at the moment, to the segment number "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"j"},{"kind":"text","text":". Using these values, we will describe the movements between the segments in the second sample: "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/098b02bf5602e2c04c4fd546d44392725b3e94e9f9fc929db4d1f319af9c888c.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/edfadc20d5b5eb994a4a1b9f7250f67b6e1842f327280bc0969191a022de3362.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/f6f1f412072fe7f2949dc2a86c445df47fec825b746af4f3436c1bb5c3c06b67.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/098b02bf5602e2c04c4fd546d44392725b3e94e9f9fc929db4d1f319af9c888c.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/71a74f63922b53e802f8f18fba93c891bec752685a7553e3c1e94f849dd4d0c2.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/c9bbbff833f285db40b698f2f29b172903e82879b4689faedc29b9b49fb660fa.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/098b02bf5602e2c04c4fd546d44392725b3e94e9f9fc929db4d1f319af9c888c.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/edfadc20d5b5eb994a4a1b9f7250f67b6e1842f327280bc0969191a022de3362.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/222f92bd73d8a032070ed9e544cea32c337c99aefad7a0499040752879b5a4e7.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/098b02bf5602e2c04c4fd546d44392725b3e94e9f9fc929db4d1f319af9c888c.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/71a74f63922b53e802f8f18fba93c891bec752685a7553e3c1e94f849dd4d0c2.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/f6f1f412072fe7f2949dc2a86c445df47fec825b746af4f3436c1bb5c3c06b67.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/098b02bf5602e2c04c4fd546d44392725b3e94e9f9fc929db4d1f319af9c888c.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/edfadc20d5b5eb994a4a1b9f7250f67b6e1842f327280bc0969191a022de3362.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/9b7705829b5f740e1d6dcd36808aa8167a8581c563f9ce072958d760b4df34bc.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/098b02bf5602e2c04c4fd546d44392725b3e94e9f9fc929db4d1f319af9c888c.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/71a74f63922b53e802f8f18fba93c891bec752685a7553e3c1e94f849dd4d0c2.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/5c927a937603c18245504a27dbedf7e4d107eaa687693201e17d906b56b3803f.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/098b02bf5602e2c04c4fd546d44392725b3e94e9f9fc929db4d1f319af9c888c.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/edfadc20d5b5eb994a4a1b9f7250f67b6e1842f327280bc0969191a022de3362.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/f6f1f412072fe7f2949dc2a86c445df47fec825b746af4f3436c1bb5c3c06b67.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/098b02bf5602e2c04c4fd546d44392725b3e94e9f9fc929db4d1f319af9c888c.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/71a74f63922b53e802f8f18fba93c891bec752685a7553e3c1e94f849dd4d0c2.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/c9bbbff833f285db40b698f2f29b172903e82879b4689faedc29b9b49fb660fa.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/098b02bf5602e2c04c4fd546d44392725b3e94e9f9fc929db4d1f319af9c888c.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/edfadc20d5b5eb994a4a1b9f7250f67b6e1842f327280bc0969191a022de3362.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"; In total: the aliens need 26 moves. The remainder after dividing "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"26"},{"kind":"text","text":" by "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"8"},{"kind":"text","text":" equals "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":", so the answer to this test is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"2"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"226A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/226/problem/A"}